# NANTUCKET Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# INSTRUCTIONS:
#   1. Copy this file: cp .env.example .env
#   2. Fill in your actual API key in .env
#   3. Never commit .env — it's already in .gitignore
#
# Load before running: source .env   (or use: export $(cat .env | xargs))
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Required for: nantucket explain, nantucket bull-bear, AI analysis in dashboard
# Get your key at: https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here

# Optional: override the Claude model used for analysis
# Default is claude-sonnet-4-6
# NANTUCKET_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6

# NOTE: Stock/ETF/futures data comes from Yahoo Finance (yfinance) — no API key needed.
# Crypto data comes from CoinGecko free API — no API key needed.
